  "description": "The user is projected onto the pronoun 'me' in the textual material, which is explicitly mapped onto Donald_Trump via the analogical mapping. The text 'and believe me, no one can wish you a better happy birthday than me' uses 'me' to refer to the speaker, who is visually represented by Donald_Trump. This creates a direct projection of the user onto the visual entity Donald_Trump, as the meme's satirical effect relies on the viewer identifying the speaker ('me') with the depicted person (Donald_Trump).",
